@lang en
IMPORT `tasco-vn19-ch1-general`

-- Fixtures for the tests of the rules: named facts, and helpers that build a claim from another with
-- one thing changed. NO assertions here, and no figure from the source: the people, dates, costs and
-- sums insured are hypothetical, chosen to make the arithmetic visible. The rates, day limits,
-- periods and thresholds the tests check are the source's, and the tests say where each comes from.

§ `Test fixtures`

§§ `People`

GIVEN `birth date` IS A DATE
GIVETH A `The insured person`
`a healthy Vietnamese insured born on` `birth date` MEANS
    `The insured person` WITH
        `nationality and residence`                  IS `Vietnamese`
        `date of birth`                              IS `birth date`
        `suffering from a neurological disease`      IS FALSE
        `suffering from a psychiatric disease`       IS FALSE
        `suffering from leprosy`                     IS FALSE
        `suffering from cancer`                      IS FALSE
        `permanent disability or injury, in percent` IS 0
        `in a period of treatment for illness or injury` IS FALSE

`Ms Lan` MEANS `a healthy Vietnamese insured born on` (YMD 1990 3 15)

GIVEN `birth date` IS A MAYBE DATE
      `organisation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `The policyholder`
`a policyholder` `birth date` `organisation` MEANS
    `The policyholder` WITH
        `an organisation`                                IS `organisation`
        `lawfully established and operating in Vietnam`  IS `organisation`
        `an individual in Vietnam`                       IS NOT `organisation`
        `date of birth`                                  IS `birth date`
        `full civil act capacity when the contract is concluded` IS TRUE
        `meets the conditions for buying insurance under the rules, conditions and terms` IS TRUE
        `an insurable interest under the law`            IS TRUE
        `date the contract is concluded`                 IS YMD 2026 1 1

`an individual policyholder` MEANS `a policyholder` (JUST (YMD 1985 1 1)) FALSE
`an employer` MEANS `a policyholder` NOTHING TRUE

`a licensed doctor` MEANS `The treating doctor` WITH
    `holds a lawful practising licence recognised by Vietnamese law` IS TRUE
    `treating within the licence and the field of training`          IS TRUE
    `relation to the insured`                                        IS `none`
    `registered to practise as required`                             IS TRUE

GIVEN k IS A `A kind of facility`
GIVETH A `The treating facility`
`a facility of kind` k MEANS
    `The treating facility` WITH
        `name`                                                         IS "a general hospital"
        `a lawful facility for medical examination and treatment in Vietnam` IS TRUE
        `able and equipped to diagnose, treat and operate`             IS TRUE
        `equipped for inpatient treatment, daily monitoring and outpatient treatment` IS TRUE
        `kind`                                                         IS k

`a general hospital` MEANS `a facility of kind` `a facility of none of the excluded kinds`

§§ `Contracts and histories`

GIVEN `start` IS A DATE
      `end`   IS A DATE
      `months` IS A NUMBER
      a IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      b IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      s IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `persons` IS A NUMBER
      `group` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the 10.2 clause` IS A BOOLEAN
      `row 3 agreed` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A `The contract`
`a contract` `start` `end` `months` a b s `persons` `group` `the 10.2 clause` `row 3 agreed` MEANS
    `The contract` WITH
        `start date`              IS `start`
        `end date`                IS `end`
        `term in months`          IS `months`
        `sum insured for scope A` IS a
        `sum insured for scope B` IS b
        `sum insured for scope C` IS s
        `premium`                 IS 1200000
        `a group contract`        IS `group`
        `number of persons insured` IS `persons`
        `waiting periods agreed`  IS `Waiting periods agreed in the contract` WITH
            `row 2, hospitalisation for a special disease or a pre-existing condition` IS NOTHING
            `row 3, ordinary illness`                                                  IS `row 3 agreed`
            `row 5, pregnancy complications`                                           IS NOTHING
            `row 6, childbirth`                                                        IS NOTHING
        `supplementary waiting-period clause stated on the contract` IS `the 10.2 clause`

-- A one-person contract for 2026, by its three sums insured.
GIVEN a IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      b IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      s IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A `The contract`
`a 2026 contract insuring` a b s MEANS
    `a contract` (YMD 2026 1 1) (YMD 2026 12 31) 12 a b s 1 FALSE FALSE NOTHING

`the standard contract` MEANS `a 2026 contract insuring` (JUST 20000000) (JUST 20000000) (JUST 20000000)
`the special contract`  MEANS `a 2026 contract insuring` (JUST 100000000) (JUST 100000000) (JUST 50000000)
`the 10 million contract` MEANS `a 2026 contract insuring` (JUST 10000000) (JUST 10000000) (JUST 10000000)

GIVEN `start` IS A DATE
GIVETH A `The history`
`a first contract from` `start` MEANS
    `The history` WITH
        `the previous contract`                           IS NOTHING
        `start of the insured's continuous participation` IS `start`
        `date of the most recent reinstatement`           IS NOTHING

GIVEN p IS A `The previous contract`
      `since` IS A DATE
GIVETH A `The history`
`a renewal of` p `continuous since` `since` MEANS
    `The history` WITH
        `the previous contract`                           IS JUST p
        `start of the insured's continuous participation` IS `since`
        `date of the most recent reinstatement`           IS NOTHING

GIVEN `start` IS A DATE
      `end`   IS A DATE
      a IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      b IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      s IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A `The previous contract`
`a previous contract` `start` `end` a b s MEANS
    `The previous contract` WITH
        `start date`              IS `start`
        `end date`                IS `end`
        `the same insured person` IS TRUE
        `sum insured for scope A` IS a
        `sum insured for scope B` IS b
        `sum insured for scope C` IS s

-- The 2025 contract before the 2026 standard contract, same sums insured.
`the 2025 standard contract` MEANS `a previous contract` (YMD 2025 1 1) (YMD 2025 12 31) (JUST 20000000) (JUST 20000000) (JUST 20000000)

GIVEN `paid under B` IS A NUMBER
      `paid under C` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The state of the contract`
`a state with payments of` `paid under B` `under B and` `paid under C` `under C` MEANS
    `The state of the contract` WITH
        `date the premium was not paid in full or on time`  IS NOTHING
        `date of an earlier death or total permanent disability of the insured` IS NOTHING
        `date Tasco terminated for ineligibility under Article 4.1(e)` IS NOTHING
        `amount already paid under scope A`                 IS 0
        `amount already paid under scope B`                 IS `paid under B`
        `amount already paid under scope C this policy year` IS `paid under C`

`a clean state` MEANS `a state with payments of` 0 `under B and` 0 `under C`

§§ `Illnesses, stays, surgeries, injuries`

GIVEN `special` IS A BOOLEAN
      `treated before` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `The illness`
`an illness` `special` `treated before` MEANS
    `The illness` WITH
        `a special disease`                                             IS `special`
        `treated within the 3 years before the start date`              IS `treated before`
        `symptoms or onset before the start date, known to the insured` IS FALSE

`an ordinary illness`        MEANS `an illness` FALSE FALSE
`a special disease`          MEANS `an illness` TRUE FALSE
`a pre-existing condition`   MEANS `an illness` FALSE TRUE

GIVEN `admitted`   IS A DATE
      `discharged` IS A DATE
      `hours`      IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `cost`       IS A NUMBER
      `used`       IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A hospital stay`
`a stay` `admitted` `discharged` `hours` `cost` `used` MEANS
    `A hospital stay` WITH
        `admission date`                               IS `admitted`
        `discharge date`                               IS `discharged`
        `hours in hospital`                            IS `hours`
        `admission and discharge procedures completed` IS TRUE
        `actual reasonable cost of treatment`          IS `cost`
        `days already paid this policy year, same kind of medicine` IS `used`

GIVEN `on`  IS A DATE
      `percent` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `cost` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A surgery`
`a surgery` `on` `percent` `cost` MEANS
    `A surgery` WITH
        `date of surgery`                                                     IS `on`
        `by licensed surgeons, by hand or with medical equipment, in a hospital` IS TRUE
        `in the Ministry of Health list of surgeries`                         IS TRUE
        `percentage in the surgery table`                                     IS `percent`
        `cost of consultation, anaesthesia, the operation and the operating room` IS `cost`

GIVEN k        IS A `A consequence of an accident`
      `began`  IS A DATE
      `certified` IS A DATE
      `percent` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `cost`   IS A NUMBER
      `paid`   IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An accidental injury`
`an injury` k `began` `certified` `percent` `cost` `paid` MEANS
    `An accidental injury` WITH
        `consequence`                           IS k
        `date the consequence began`            IS `began`
        `date of certification`                 IS `certified`
        `percentage in the injury table`        IS `percent`
        `actual reasonable cost of treatment`   IS `cost`
        `amount already paid for this accident` IS `paid`

§§ `Base claims`

-- A five-day stay in Western medicine for an ordinary illness, 1-5 May 2026, under the standard
-- contract (all sums insured 20 million dong), a first contract, nothing paid before.
`the illness stay claim` MEANS
    `A claim` WITH
        `the policyholder`           IS `an individual policyholder`
        `the insured person`         IS `Ms Lan`
        `the contract`               IS `the standard contract`
        `the history`                IS `a first contract from` (YMD 2026 1 1)
        `the state of the contract`  IS `a clean state`
        `benefit claimed`            IS `III.1 hospitalisation in Western medicine`
        `cause`                      IS `an illness`
        `date of the insured event`  IS YMD 2026 5 1
        `date treatment began`       IS YMD 2026 5 1
        `in Vietnam`                 IS TRUE
        `the illness`                IS JUST `an ordinary illness`
        `maternity event`            IS NOTHING
        `a miscarriage, or a complication that required curettage on a doctor's order` IS FALSE
        `the stay`                   IS JUST (`a stay` (YMD 2026 5 1) (YMD 2026 5 5) NOTHING 3000000 0)
        `the surgery`                IS NOTHING
        `the injury`                 IS NOTHING
        `the treating doctor`        IS JUST `a licensed doctor`
        `the treating facility`      IS JUST `a general hospital`
        `circumstances`              IS EMPTY
        `breath alcohol while driving` IS NOTHING
        `blood alcohol while driving`  IS NOTHING
        `paid by another insurance contract for the same treatment` IS 0

-- A temporary injury from an accident on 1 May 2026, treated at a cost of 3 million; the injury
-- table's percentage for it is supplied as 5 (a hypothetical figure: the table is not in the source).
`the accident claim` MEANS
    `claiming` `II.3 temporary injury from accident` `an accident`
        (`with the illness` NOTHING
            (`with the stay` NOTHING
                (`with the injury` (JUST (`an injury` `temporary injury` (YMD 2026 5 1) (YMD 2026 5 1) (JUST 5) 3000000 0))
                    `the illness stay claim`)))

-- A death from an ordinary illness that began on 1 May 2026, with no treatment.
`the death claim` MEANS
    `claiming` `I.1 death from illness, sickness or maternity` `an illness`
        (`with the stay` NOTHING
            (`with the doctor` NOTHING
                (`with the facility` NOTHING `the illness stay claim`)))

